<h1>What is HARMONY連</h1>
<p>HARMONYREN is an Open Innovation Collective founded in Italy, dedicated to researching, proposing, debating,
  and turning ideas into reality.</p>
<p>HARMONYREN is currently in its pre-launch phase. If you’re interested, reach out to us at
  <a href="/contact-us.html">Contact Us</a>.
</p>

<h2>Departments</h2>
<p>To organize the domains where HARMONYREN operates, the following departments were created:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Department of Research and Development (RDD), our core domain</li>
  <li>Department of Existential Operations (EOD)</li>
  <li>Department of Game Development (GDD)</li>
  <li>Department of Construction and Infrastructure (CID)</li>
  <li>Department of Medicine (MED)</li>
</ul>
